note: an error three calls deep: the chain says how it got there
to average of marks and label and loud:
    let count be the length of marks
    give back marks added together divided by count
to report with title and region:
    say title followed by ": " followed by average of (an empty list of numbers) and "x" and no
to start:
    report with "Quarterly figures for the whole of the long financial year" and "North"
say "Starting"
start
